{"id":"3b81403d289d8fbb","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-initial-algebra-uniqueness.md","title":"初始模型唯一到同构","display":"thm-initial-algebra-uniqueness — 初始模型唯一到同构","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-initial-algebra-uniqueness","aliases":["56-thm-initial-algebra-uniqueness"],"display":"thm-initial-algebra-uniqueness — 初始模型唯一到同构","depends_on":["[[56-df-initial-algebra]]","[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]"],"source_section":"7.2.3","source_pages":"267","source_ocr_blocks":[288],"source_statement_status":"source-exercise-compared; local-proof-expanded","source_proof_status":"local-universal-property-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-initial-algebra-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-initial-algebra-uniqueness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-initial-algebra-uniqueness — 初始模型唯一到同构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a8374d48d26bd5\" href=\"?note=a0a8374d48d26bd5\" title=\"56-df-initial-algebra\">56-df-initial-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f75e1125f61f318\" href=\"?note=4f75e1125f61f318\" title=\"56-df-sigma-homomorphism\">56-df-sigma-homomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.2.3"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"267"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>288</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-exercise-compared; local-proof-expanded"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-universal-property-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,E\">\\(\\Sigma,V,E\\)</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(A,I)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(B,J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(B,J)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0a8374d48d26bd5\" href=\"?note=a0a8374d48d26bd5\" title=\"56-df-initial-algebra\">56-df-initial-algebra</a>。同态、同构见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f75e1125f61f318\" href=\"?note=4f75e1125f61f318\" title=\"56-df-sigma-homomorphism\">56-df-sigma-homomorphism</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!h\\in B^A\\;\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!h\\in B^A\\;\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists h\\in B^A\\;\\exists k\\in A^B\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\land\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(B,J,A,I,k)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(k(h(a))=a)\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(h(k(b))=b)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists h\\in B^A\\;\\exists k\\in A^B\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\land\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(B,J,A,I,k)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(k(h(a))=a)\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(h(k(b))=b)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Exercise 7.2.3(i)–(ii)，本地展开证明：两次初始性给出h与k；同态的复合仍为同态，恒等函数也是同态。由于从初始模型到自身的同态唯一，两个复合分别为恒等。因此h为双射且保持运算，k是其逆。同构也是同态，故h的唯一性继承自初始性。此结论不说两个模型的载体字面相同。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.2.3，印刷页 267。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-initial-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a0a8374d48d26bd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-initial-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sigma-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4f75e1125f61f318","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-initial-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a0a8374d48d26bd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设同一 $\\Sigma,V,E$ 下 $\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(A,I)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(B,J)$，见 [[56-df-initial-algebra]]。同态、同构见 [[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sigma-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4f75e1125f61f318","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设同一 $\\Sigma,V,E$ 下 $\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(A,I)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(B,J)$，见 [[56-df-initial-algebra]]。同态、同构见 [[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,V,E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(B,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!h\\in B^A\\;\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists h\\in B^A\\;\\exists k\\in A^B\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\land\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(B,J,A,I,k)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(k(h(a))=a)\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(h(k(b))=b)\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1681,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-260","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-initial-algebra-uniqueness.md]]"}],"outgoing":["a0a8374d48d26bd5","4f75e1125f61f318"]}